#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:9
msgid "Command line and environment"
msgstr "命令列與環境"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:11
msgid ""
"The CPython interpreter scans the command line and the environment for "
"various settings."
msgstr "CPython 直譯器會掃描命令列與環境以取得各種設定。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:16
msgid ""
"Other implementations' command line schemes may differ.  "
"See :ref:`implementations` for further resources."
msgstr ""
"其他實作的命令列方案可能有所不同。更多資源請參閱\\ :ref:`implementations`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:23
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令列"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:25
msgid "When invoking Python, you may specify any of these options::"
msgstr "呼叫 Python 時，你可以指定以下任一選項： ::"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:27
msgid ""
"python [-bBdEhiIOPqRsSuvVWx?] [-c command | -m module-name | script | - ] "
"[args]"
msgstr ""
"python [-bBdEhiIOPqRsSuvVWx?] [-c command | -m module-name | script | - ] "
"[args]"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:29
msgid ""
"The most common use case is, of course, a simple invocation of a script::"
msgstr "最常見的使用情境當然是單純地呼叫一個腳本： ::"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:31
msgid "python myscript.py"
msgstr "python myscript.py"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:37
msgid "Interface options"
msgstr "介面選項"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:39
msgid ""
"The interpreter interface resembles that of the UNIX shell, but provides "
"some additional methods of invocation:"
msgstr "直譯器介面類似於 UNIX shell，但提供了一些額外的呼叫方式："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:42
msgid ""
"When called with standard input connected to a tty device, it prompts for "
"commands and executes them until an EOF (an end-of-file character, you can "
"produce that with :kbd:`Ctrl-D` on UNIX or :kbd:`Ctrl-Z, Enter` on Windows) "
"is read. For more on interactive mode, see :ref:`tut-interac`."
msgstr ""
"若以連接到 tty 裝置的標準輸入來呼叫，它會提示輸入命令並執行，直到讀取到 EOF"
"（檔案結尾字元，在 UNIX 上可以用 :kbd:`Ctrl-D`、在 Windows 上可以"
"用 :kbd:`Ctrl-Z, Enter` 產生）為止。更多關於互動模式的資訊，請見\\ :ref:`tut-"
"interac`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:46
msgid ""
"When called with a file name argument or with a file as standard input, it "
"reads and executes a script from that file."
msgstr ""
"若以檔案名稱引數或以檔案作為標準輸入來呼叫，它會從該檔案讀取並執行腳本。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:48
msgid ""
"When called with a directory name argument, it reads and executes an "
"appropriately named script from that directory."
msgstr "若以目錄名稱引數來呼叫，它會從該目錄讀取並執行一個具有適當名稱的腳本。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:50
msgid ""
"When called with ``-c command``, it executes the Python statement(s) given "
"as *command*.  Here *command* may contain multiple statements separated by "
"newlines."
msgstr ""
"若以 ``-c command`` 呼叫，它會執行 *command* 所給定的 Python 陳述式。此處 "
"*command* 可以包含以換行字元分隔的多個陳述式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:53
msgid ""
"When called with ``-m module-name``, the given module is located using the "
"standard import mechanism and executed as a script."
msgstr ""
"若以 ``-m module-name`` 呼叫，會使用標準引入機制找到給定的模組，並將其作為腳"
"本執行。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:56
msgid ""
"In non-interactive mode, the entire input is parsed before it is executed."
msgstr "在非互動模式下，整個輸入會在執行前先被剖析。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:58
msgid ""
"An interface option terminates the list of options consumed by the "
"interpreter, all consecutive arguments will end up in :data:`sys.argv` -- "
"note that the first element, subscript zero (``sys.argv[0]``), is a string "
"reflecting the program's source."
msgstr ""
"介面選項會結束直譯器所處理的選項串列，所有後續的引數都會被放"
"入 :data:`sys.argv` 中 -- 請注意第一個元素，也就是索引為零的元素 "
"(``sys.argv[0]``)，是一個反映程式來源的字串。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:65
msgid ""
"Execute the Python code in *command*.  *command* can be one or more "
"statements separated by newlines, with significant leading whitespace as in "
"normal module code."
msgstr ""
"執行 *command* 中的 Python 程式碼。*command* 可以是一或多個以換行字元分隔的陳"
"述式，其中開頭的空白與一般模組程式碼中一樣具有意義。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:69
msgid ""
"If this option is given, the first element of :data:`sys.argv` will be ``\"-"
"c\"`` and the current directory will be added to the start "
"of :data:`sys.path` (allowing modules in that directory to be imported as "
"top level modules)."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定此選項，:data:`sys.argv` 的第一個元素將會是 ``\"-c\"``，且目前目錄"
"會被加到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭（讓該目錄中的模組能作為頂層模組被引入）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:74
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``cpython.run_command`` with "
"argument ``command``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``command`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` "
"``cpython.run_command``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:76
msgid "*command* is automatically dedented before execution."
msgstr "*command* 會在執行前自動移除縮排。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:81
msgid ""
"Locate the module using the standard import mechanism and execute its "
"contents as the :mod:`__main__` module."
msgstr "使用標準引入機制找到模組，並將其內容作為 :mod:`__main__` 模組執行。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:84
msgid ""
"Since the argument is a *module* name, you must not give a file extension "
"(``.py``).  The module name should be a valid absolute Python module name, "
"but the implementation may not always enforce this (e.g. it may allow you to "
"use a name that includes a hyphen)."
msgstr ""
"由於引數是\\ *模組*\\ 名稱，你不可以給定副檔名 (``.py``)。模組名稱應為有效的 "
"Python 絕對模組名稱，但實作不一定會強制檢查這點（例如它可能允許你使用包含連字"
"號的名稱）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:89
msgid ""
"Package names (including namespace packages) are also permitted. When a "
"package name is supplied instead of a normal module, the interpreter will "
"execute ``<pkg>.__main__`` as the main module. This behaviour is "
"deliberately similar to the handling of directories and zipfiles that are "
"passed to the interpreter as the script argument."
msgstr ""
"套件名稱（包括命名空間套件）也是允許的。當提供的是套件名稱而非一般模組時，直"
"譯器會將 ``<pkg>.__main__`` 作為主模組執行。此行為刻意設計成與直譯器處理以腳"
"本引數傳入的目錄和 zip 檔案的方式類似。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:98
msgid ""
"This option cannot be used with built-in modules and extension modules "
"written in C, since they do not have Python module files. However, it can "
"still be used for precompiled modules, even if the original source file is "
"not available."
msgstr ""
"此選項不能用於內建模組和以 C 撰寫的擴充模組，因為它們沒有 Python 模組檔案。然"
"而，它仍可用於預先編譯的模組，即使原本的原始檔已不存在。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:103
msgid ""
"If this option is given, the first element of :data:`sys.argv` will be the "
"full path to the module file (while the module file is being located, the "
"first element will be set to ``\"-m\"``). As with the :option:`-c` option, "
"the current directory will be added to the start of :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定此選項，:data:`sys.argv` 的第一個元素將會是模組檔案的完整路徑（在尋"
"找模組檔案期間，第一個元素會被設為 ``\"-m\"``）。與 :option:`-c` 選項相同，目"
"前目錄會被加到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:108
msgid ""
":option:`-I` option can  be used to run the script in isolated mode "
"where :data:`sys.path` contains neither the current directory nor the user's "
"site-packages directory. All ``PYTHON*`` environment variables are ignored, "
"too."
msgstr ""
":option:`-I` 選項可用於在隔離模式下執行腳本，此時 :data:`sys.path` 既不包含目"
"前目錄，也不包含使用者的 site-packages 目錄。所有 ``PYTHON*`` 環境變數也都會"
"被忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:113
msgid ""
"Many standard library modules contain code that is invoked on their "
"execution as a script.  An example is the :mod:`timeit` module::"
msgstr ""
"許多標準函式庫模組都包含在作為腳本執行時會被呼叫的程式碼。其中一個例子"
"是 :mod:`timeit` 模組： ::"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:116
msgid ""
"python -m timeit -s \"setup here\" \"benchmarked code here\"\n"
"python -m timeit -h # for details"
msgstr ""
"python -m timeit -s \"setup here\" \"benchmarked code here\"\n"
"python -m timeit -h # 詳細說明"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:119
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``cpython.run_module`` with "
"argument ``module-name``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``module-name`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` "
"``cpython.run_module``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:122
msgid ":func:`runpy.run_module`"
msgstr ":func:`runpy.run_module`"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:123 ../../using/cmdline.rst:175
msgid "Equivalent functionality directly available to Python code"
msgstr "可直接供 Python 程式碼使用的同等功能"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:125
msgid ":pep:`338` -- Executing modules as scripts"
msgstr ":pep:`338` -- 將模組作為腳本執行"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:127
msgid "Supply the package name to run a ``__main__`` submodule."
msgstr "提供套件名稱來執行 ``__main__`` 子模組。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:130
msgid "namespace packages are also supported"
msgstr "也支援命名空間套件"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:137
msgid ""
"Read commands from standard input (:data:`sys.stdin`).  If standard input is "
"a terminal, :option:`-i` is implied."
msgstr ""
"從標準輸入 (:data:`sys.stdin`) 讀取命令。如果標準輸入是終端機，則隱"
"含 :option:`-i`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:140
msgid ""
"If this option is given, the first element of :data:`sys.argv` will be ``\"-"
"\"`` and the current directory will be added to the start "
"of :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定此選項，:data:`sys.argv` 的第一個元素將會是 ``\"-\"``，且目前目錄會"
"被加到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:144 ../../using/cmdline.rst:886
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``cpython.run_stdin`` with no "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"引發一個不附帶引數的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` ``cpython.run_stdin``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:150
msgid ""
"Execute the Python code contained in *script*, which must be a filesystem "
"path (absolute or relative) referring to either a Python file, a directory "
"containing a ``__main__.py`` file, or a zipfile containing a ``__main__.py`` "
"file."
msgstr ""
"執行 *script* 中的 Python 程式碼，*script* 必須是一個檔案系統路徑（絕對或相對"
"路徑），指向一個 Python 檔案、一個包含 ``__main__.py`` 檔案的目錄或一個包含 "
"``__main__.py`` 檔案的 zip 檔案。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:155
msgid ""
"If this option is given, the first element of :data:`sys.argv` will be the "
"script name as given on the command line."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定此選項，:data:`sys.argv` 的第一個元素將會是命令列上所給定的腳本名"
"稱。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:158
msgid ""
"If the script name refers directly to a Python file, the directory "
"containing that file is added to the start of :data:`sys.path`, and the file "
"is executed as the :mod:`__main__` module."
msgstr ""
"如果腳本名稱直接指向一個 Python 檔案，則包含該檔案的目錄會被加"
"到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭，且該檔案會作為 :mod:`__main__` 模組執行。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:162
msgid ""
"If the script name refers to a directory or zipfile, the script name is "
"added to the start of :data:`sys.path` and the ``__main__.py`` file in that "
"location is executed as the :mod:`__main__` module."
msgstr ""
"如果腳本名稱指向一個目錄或 zip 檔案，則腳本名稱會被加到 :data:`sys.path` 的開"
"頭，且該位置中的 ``__main__.py`` 檔案會作為 :mod:`__main__` 模組執行。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:166
msgid ""
":option:`-I` option can  be used to run the script in isolated mode "
"where :data:`sys.path` contains neither the script's directory nor the "
"user's site-packages directory. All ``PYTHON*`` environment variables are "
"ignored, too."
msgstr ""
":option:`-I` 選項可用於在隔離模式下執行腳本，此時 :data:`sys.path` 既不包含腳"
"本所在的目錄，也不包含使用者的 site-packages 目錄。所有 ``PYTHON*`` 環境變數"
"也都會被忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:171
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``cpython.run_file`` with "
"argument ``filename``."
msgstr ""
"引發一個附帶引數 ``filename`` 的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 <auditing>` "
"``cpython.run_file``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:174
msgid ":func:`runpy.run_path`"
msgstr ":func:`runpy.run_path`"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:178
msgid ""
"If no interface option is given, :option:`-i` is implied, ``sys.argv[0]`` is "
"an empty string (``\"\"``) and the current directory will be added to the "
"start of :data:`sys.path`.  Also, tab-completion and history editing is "
"automatically enabled, if available on your platform (see :ref:`rlcompleter-"
"config`)."
msgstr ""
"如果沒有給定介面選項，則隱含 :option:`-i`，``sys.argv[0]`` 為空字串 "
"(``\"\"``)，且目前目錄會被加到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭。此外，如果你的平台支"
"援，Tab 鍵自動完成和歷史記錄編輯會自動啟用（請參閱 :ref:`rlcompleter-"
"config`）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:184
msgid ":ref:`tut-invoking`"
msgstr ":ref:`tut-invoking`"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:186
msgid "Automatic enabling of tab-completion and history editing."
msgstr "自動啟用 Tab 鍵自動完成和歷史記錄編輯。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:193
msgid "Generic options"
msgstr "通用選項"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:199
msgid ""
"Print a short description of all command line options and corresponding "
"environment variables and exit."
msgstr "印出所有命令列選項及對應環境變數的簡短說明並結束。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:204
msgid ""
"Print a short description of Python-specific environment variables and exit."
msgstr "印出 Python 特有環境變數的簡短說明並結束。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:211
msgid ""
"Print a description of implementation-specific :option:`-X` options and exit."
msgstr "印出實作特有的 :option:`-X` 選項說明並結束。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:218
msgid "Print complete usage information and exit."
msgstr "印出完整使用資訊並結束。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:225
msgid "Print the Python version number and exit.  Example output could be:"
msgstr "印出 Python 版本號碼並結束。輸出範例可能是："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:227
msgid "Python 3.8.0b2+"
msgstr "Python 3.8.0b2+"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:231
msgid "When given twice, print more information about the build, like:"
msgstr "若給定兩次，則印出更多關於建置的資訊，例如："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:233
msgid ""
"Python 3.8.0b2+ (3.8:0c076caaa8, Apr 20 2019, 21:55:00)\n"
"[GCC 6.2.0 20161005]"
msgstr ""
"Python 3.8.0b2+ (3.8:0c076caaa8, Apr 20 2019, 21:55:00)\n"
"[GCC 6.2.0 20161005]"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:238
msgid "The ``-VV`` option."
msgstr "``-VV`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:245
msgid "Miscellaneous options"
msgstr "其他選項"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:249
msgid ""
"Issue a warning when converting :class:`bytes` or :class:`bytearray` "
"to :class:`str` without specifying encoding or comparing :class:`!bytes` "
"or :class:`!bytearray` with :class:`!str` or :class:`!bytes` "
"with :class:`int`. Issue an error when the option is given twice (:option:`!-"
"bb`)."
msgstr ""
"在未指定編碼的情況下將 :class:`bytes` 或 :class:`bytearray` 轉換"
"為 :class:`str`、將 :class:`!bytes` 或 :class:`!bytearray` 與 :class:`!str` "
"比較，或將 :class:`!bytes` 與 :class:`int` 比較時，發出警告。若給定此選項兩"
"次 (:option:`!-bb`)，則發出錯誤。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:254
msgid "Affects also comparisons of :class:`bytes` with :class:`int`."
msgstr "也會影響 :class:`bytes` 與 :class:`int` 的比較。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:259
msgid ""
"Deprecate :option:`-b` and :option:`!-bb` command line options and schedule "
"them to become no-op in Python 3.17. These were primarily helpers for the "
"Python 2 -> 3 transition. Starting with Python 3.17, no :exc:`BytesWarning` "
"will be raised for these cases; use a type checker instead."
msgstr ""
"棄用 :option:`-b` 和 :option:`!-bb` 命令列選項，並預計在 Python 3.17 中使其不"
"再有任何作用。這兩個選項主要是協助從 Python 2 過渡到 3 的輔助工具。從 Python "
"3.17 開始，這些情況將不再引發 :exc:`BytesWarning`；請改用型別檢查器。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:268
msgid ""
"If given, Python won't try to write ``.pyc`` files on the import of source "
"modules.  See also :envvar:`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE`."
msgstr ""
"如果有給定此選項，Python 在引入原始碼模組時不會嘗試寫入 ``.pyc`` 檔案。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:274
msgid ""
"Control the validation behavior of hash-based ``.pyc`` files. See :ref:`pyc-"
"invalidation`. When set to ``default``, checked and unchecked hash-based "
"bytecode cache files are validated according to their default semantics. "
"When set to ``always``, all hash-based ``.pyc`` files, whether checked or "
"unchecked, are validated against their corresponding source file. When set "
"to ``never``, hash-based ``.pyc`` files are not validated against their "
"corresponding source files."
msgstr ""
"控制雜湊架構的 ``.pyc`` 檔案的驗證行為。請參閱\\ :ref:`pyc-invalidation`。當"
"設為 ``default`` 時，需檢查和不需檢查的雜湊架構位元組碼快取檔案，會依照其預設"
"語意進行驗證。當設為 ``always`` 時，所有雜湊架構的 ``.pyc`` 檔案，無論需檢查"
"或不需檢查，都會根據其對應的原始檔進行驗證。當設為 ``never`` 時，雜湊架構的 "
"``.pyc`` 檔案不會根據其對應的原始檔進行驗證。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:282
msgid ""
"The semantics of timestamp-based ``.pyc`` files are unaffected by this "
"option."
msgstr "時間戳架構的 ``.pyc`` 檔案的語意不受此選項影響。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:288
msgid ""
"Turn on parser debugging output (for expert only). See also "
"the :envvar:`PYTHONDEBUG` environment variable."
msgstr ""
"開啟剖析器除錯輸出（僅供專家使用）。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONDEBUG` 環境變數。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:291
msgid ""
"This option requires a :ref:`debug build of Python <debug-build>`, otherwise "
"it's ignored."
msgstr "此選項需要\\ :ref:`除錯建置的 Python <debug-build>`，否則會被忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:297
msgid ""
"Ignore all ``PYTHON*`` environment variables, e.g. :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` "
"and :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`, that might be set."
msgstr ""
"忽略所有可能已設定的 ``PYTHON*`` 環境變數，例如 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` "
"和 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:300
msgid "See also the :option:`-P` and :option:`-I` (isolated) options."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-P` 和 :option:`-I`\\ （隔離模式）選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:305
msgid "Enter interactive mode after execution."
msgstr "執行後進入互動模式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:307
msgid ""
"Using the :option:`-i` option will enter interactive mode in any of the "
"following circumstances\\:"
msgstr "在以下任一情況下，使用 :option:`-i` 選項都會進入互動模式："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:309
msgid "When a script is passed as first argument"
msgstr "當腳本作為第一個引數傳入時"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:310
msgid "When the :option:`-c` option is used"
msgstr "當使用 :option:`-c` 選項時"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:311
msgid "When the :option:`-m` option is used"
msgstr "當使用 :option:`-m` 選項時"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:313
msgid ""
"Interactive mode will start even when :data:`sys.stdin` does not appear to "
"be a terminal. The :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` file is not read."
msgstr ""
"即使 :data:`sys.stdin` 看起來不是終端機，互動模式也會啟"
"動。:envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` 檔案不會被讀取。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:316
msgid ""
"This can be useful to inspect global variables or a stack trace when a "
"script raises an exception.  See also :envvar:`PYTHONINSPECT`."
msgstr ""
"當腳本引發例外時，這對於檢查全域變數或堆疊追蹤很有用。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHONINSPECT`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:322
msgid ""
"Run Python in isolated mode. This also implies :option:`-E`, :option:`-P` "
"and :option:`-s` options."
msgstr ""
"以隔離模式執行 Python。這也隱含了 :option:`-E`、:option:`-P` 和 :option:`-s` "
"選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:325
msgid ""
"In isolated mode, Python does not prepend the potentially unsafe "
"path :data:`sys._path0` to :data:`sys.path`, and ignores all ``PYTHON*`` "
"environment variables, e.g.  :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` and :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`, "
"that might be set. Further restrictions may be imposed to prevent the user "
"from injecting malicious code."
msgstr ""
"在隔離模式下，Python 不會將可能不安全的路徑 :data:`sys._path0` 加"
"到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭，並且會忽略所有可能已設定的 ``PYTHON*`` 環境變數，"
"例如 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` 和 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`。也可能會施加更多限制，以防"
"止使用者注入惡意程式碼。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:337
msgid ""
"Remove assert statements and any code conditional on the value "
"of :const:`__debug__`.  Augment the filename for compiled (:term:`bytecode`) "
"files by adding ``.opt-1`` before the ``.pyc`` extension (see :pep:`488`).  "
"See also :envvar:`PYTHONOPTIMIZE`."
msgstr ""
"移除 assert 陳述式以及任何依 :const:`__debug__` 的值而定的程式碼。編譯後"
"（:term:`位元組碼 <bytecode>`）檔案的檔案名稱會在 ``.pyc`` 副檔名前加上 "
"``.opt-1``\\ （請參閱 :pep:`488`）。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONOPTIMIZE`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:342 ../../using/cmdline.rst:352
msgid "Modify ``.pyc`` filenames according to :pep:`488`."
msgstr "根據 :pep:`488` 修改 ``.pyc`` 檔案名稱。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:348
msgid ""
"Do :option:`-O` and also discard docstrings.  Augment the filename for "
"compiled (:term:`bytecode`) files by adding ``.opt-2`` before the ``.pyc`` "
"extension (see :pep:`488`)."
msgstr ""
"執行 :option:`-O` 並同時捨棄說明字串。編譯後（:term:`位元組碼 <bytecode>`）檔"
"案的檔案名稱會在 ``.pyc`` 副檔名前加上 ``.opt-2``\\ （請參閱 :pep:`488`）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:358
msgid ""
"Don't prepend the potentially unsafe path :data:`sys._path0` "
"to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr "不將可能不安全的路徑 :data:`sys._path0` 加到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:361
msgid ""
"See also the :envvar:`PYTHONSAFEPATH` environment variable, and :option:`-E` "
"and :option:`-I` (isolated) options."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONSAFEPATH` 環境變數，以及 :option:`-E` 和 :option:`-"
"I`\\ （隔離模式）選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:369
msgid ""
"Don't display the copyright and version messages even in interactive mode."
msgstr "即使在互動模式下也不顯示版權和版本訊息。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:376
msgid ""
"Turn on hash randomization. This option only has an effect if "
"the :envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` environment variable is set to anything other "
"than ``random``, since hash randomization is enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"開啟雜湊隨機化。由於雜湊隨機化預設為啟用，此選項只有"
"在 :envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` 環境變數被設為 ``random`` 以外的值時才有作用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:380
msgid ""
"On previous versions of Python, this option turns on hash randomization, so "
"that the :meth:`~object.__hash__` values of str and bytes objects are "
"\"salted\" with an unpredictable random value.  Although they remain "
"constant within an individual Python process, they are not predictable "
"between repeated invocations of Python."
msgstr ""
"在先前的 Python 版本中，此選項會開啟雜湊隨機化，使 str 和 bytes 物件"
"的 :meth:`~object.__hash__` 值以一個無法預測的隨機值「加鹽」。雖然這些值在單"
"一 Python 行程中保持不變，但在重複呼叫 Python 之間是無法預測的。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:386
msgid ""
"Hash randomization is intended to provide protection against a denial-of-"
"service caused by carefully chosen inputs that exploit the worst case "
"performance of a dict construction, *O*\\ (*n*\\ :sup:`2`) complexity.  See "
"https://ocert.org/advisories/ocert-2011-003.html for details."
msgstr ""
"雜湊隨機化旨在防範阻斷服務攻擊，這類攻擊會以精心挑選的輸入，利用 dict 建構的"
"最差情況效能，也就是 *O*\\ (*n*\\ :sup:`2`) 複雜度。更多細節請見 https://"
"ocert.org/advisories/ocert-2011-003.html 。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:391
msgid ""
":envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` allows you to set a fixed value for the hash seed "
"secret."
msgstr ":envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` 可讓你為雜湊種子密鑰設定一個固定值。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:396
msgid "The option is no longer ignored."
msgstr "此選項不再被忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:402
msgid ""
"Don't add the :data:`user site-packages directory <site.USER_SITE>` "
"to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
"不將\\ :data:`使用者 site-packages 目錄 <site.USER_SITE>`\\ 加"
"入 :data:`sys.path`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:405
msgid "See also :envvar:`PYTHONNOUSERSITE`."
msgstr "另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONNOUSERSITE`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:409 ../../using/cmdline.rst:984
#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:999
msgid ":pep:`370` -- Per user site-packages directory"
msgstr ":pep:`370` -- 每個使用者各自的 site-packages 目錄"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:414
msgid ""
"Disable the import of the module :mod:`site` and the site-dependent "
"manipulations of :data:`sys.path` that it entails.  Also disable these "
"manipulations if :mod:`site` is explicitly imported later "
"(call :func:`site.main` if you want them to be triggered)."
msgstr ""
"停用 :mod:`site` 模組的引入，以及它所帶來的、與 site 相關的 :data:`sys.path` "
"操作。如果之後明確引入 :mod:`site`，也會停用這些操作（如果你想觸發它們，請呼"
"叫 :func:`site.main`）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:422
msgid ""
"Force the stdout and stderr streams to be unbuffered.  This option has no "
"effect on the stdin stream."
msgstr "強制 stdout 和 stderr 串流不使用緩衝。此選項對 stdin 串流沒有影響。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:425
msgid "See also :envvar:`PYTHONUNBUFFERED`."
msgstr "另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONUNBUFFERED`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:427
msgid "The text layer of the stdout and stderr streams now is unbuffered."
msgstr "stdout 和 stderr 串流的文字層現在不使用緩衝。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:433
msgid ""
"Print a message each time a module is initialized, showing the place "
"(filename or built-in module) from which it is loaded.  When given twice "
"(:option:`!-vv`), print a message for each file that is checked for when "
"searching for a module.  Also provides information on module cleanup at exit."
msgstr ""
"每次初始化模組時印出一則訊息，顯示載入該模組的位置（檔案名稱或內建模組）。若"
"給定兩次 (:option:`!-vv`)，則在搜尋模組時，對每個被檢查的檔案印出一則訊息。也"
"會提供結束時模組清理的相關資訊。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:438
msgid ""
"The :mod:`site` module reports the site-specific paths and :file:`.pth` "
"files being processed."
msgstr ":mod:`site` 模組會回報正在處理的 site 特定路徑和 :file:`.pth` 檔案。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:442
msgid "See also :envvar:`PYTHONVERBOSE`."
msgstr "另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONVERBOSE`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:448
msgid ""
"Warning control. Python's warning machinery by default prints warning "
"messages to :data:`sys.stderr`."
msgstr "警告控制。Python 的警告機制預設會將警告訊息印出到 :data:`sys.stderr`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:451 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1015
msgid ""
"The simplest settings apply a particular action unconditionally to all "
"warnings emitted by a process (even those that are otherwise ignored by "
"default)::"
msgstr ""
"最簡單的設定會無條件地將某個特定動作套用到行程發出的所有警告（即使是那些預設"
"會被忽略的警告）： ::"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:455
msgid ""
"-Wdefault  # Warn once per call location\n"
"-Werror    # Convert to exceptions\n"
"-Walways   # Warn every time\n"
"-Wall      # Same as -Walways\n"
"-Wmodule   # Warn once per calling module\n"
"-Wonce     # Warn once per Python process\n"
"-Wignore   # Never warn"
msgstr ""
"-Wdefault  # 每個呼叫位置警告一次\n"
"-Werror    # 轉換為例外\n"
"-Walways   # 每次都警告\n"
"-Wall      # 與 -Walways 相同\n"
"-Wmodule   # 每個發出呼叫的模組警告一次\n"
"-Wonce     # 每個 Python 行程警告一次\n"
"-Wignore   # 永不警告"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:463
msgid ""
"The action names can be abbreviated as desired and the interpreter will "
"resolve them to the appropriate action name. For example, ``-Wi`` is the "
"same as ``-Wignore``."
msgstr ""
"動作名稱可以依需要縮寫，直譯器會將其解析為適當的動作名稱。例如 ``-Wi`` 與 ``-"
"Wignore`` 相同。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:467
msgid "The full form of argument is::"
msgstr "完整的引數形式為： ::"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:469
msgid "action:message:category:module:lineno"
msgstr "action:message:category:module:lineno"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:471
msgid ""
"Empty fields match all values; trailing empty fields may be omitted. For "
"example ``-W ignore::DeprecationWarning`` ignores all DeprecationWarning "
"warnings."
msgstr ""
"空欄位會匹配所有值；尾端的空欄位可以省略。例如 ``-W "
"ignore::DeprecationWarning`` 會忽略所有 DeprecationWarning 警告。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:475
msgid ""
"The *action* field is as explained above but only applies to warnings that "
"match the remaining fields."
msgstr "*action* 欄位如上所述，但只套用於匹配其餘欄位的警告。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:478
msgid ""
"The *message* field must match the start of the warning message; this match "
"is case-insensitive. If it starts and ends with a forward slash (``/``), it "
"specifies a regular expression, otherwise it specifies a literal string."
msgstr ""
"*message* 欄位必須匹配警告訊息的開頭；此匹配不區分大小寫。如果它以正斜線 (``/"
"``) 開頭並結尾，則指定的是正規表示式，否則指定的是字面值字串。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:483
msgid ""
"The *category* field matches the warning category (ex: "
"``DeprecationWarning``). This must be a class name; the match test whether "
"the actual warning category of the message is a subclass of the specified "
"warning category."
msgstr ""
"*category* 欄位會匹配警告類別（例如 ``DeprecationWarning``）。這必須是類別名"
"稱；匹配測試的是訊息的實際警告類別是否為指定警告類別的子類別。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:488
msgid ""
"The *module* field matches the (fully qualified) module name; this match is "
"case-sensitive. If it starts and ends with a forward slash (``/``), it "
"specifies a regular expression that the start of the fully qualified module "
"name must match, otherwise it specifies a literal string that the fully "
"qualified module name must be equal to."
msgstr ""
"*module* 欄位會匹配（完整限定的）模組名稱；此匹配區分大小寫。如果它以正斜線 "
"(``/``) 開頭並結尾，則指定的是一個正規表示式，完整限定模組名稱的開頭必須與其"
"匹配；否則指定的是一個字面值字串，完整限定模組名稱必須與其相等。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:495
msgid ""
"The *lineno* field matches the line number, where zero matches all line "
"numbers and is thus equivalent to an omitted line number."
msgstr "*lineno* 欄位會匹配列號，其中零會匹配所有列號，因此等同於省略列號。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:498
msgid ""
"Multiple :option:`-W` options can be given; when a warning matches more than "
"one option, the action for the last matching option is performed. "
"Invalid :option:`-W` options are ignored (though, a warning message is "
"printed about invalid options when the first warning is issued)."
msgstr ""
"可以給定多個 :option:`-W` 選項；當一個警告匹配多個選項時，會執行最後一個匹配"
"的選項的動作。無效的 :option:`-W` 選項會被忽略（不過在發出第一個警告時，會印"
"出一則關於無效選項的警告訊息）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:503
msgid ""
"Warnings can also be controlled using the :envvar:`PYTHONWARNINGS` "
"environment variable and from within a Python program using "
"the :mod:`warnings` module. For example, the :func:`warnings.filterwarnings` "
"function can be used to use a regular expression on the warning message."
msgstr ""
"警告也可以使用 :envvar:`PYTHONWARNINGS` 環境變數來控制，或在 Python 程式中使"
"用 :mod:`warnings` 模組來控制。例如，:func:`warnings.filterwarnings` 函式可用"
"來對警告訊息使用正規表示式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:508 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1027
msgid ""
"See :ref:`warning-filter` and :ref:`describing-warning-filters` for more "
"details."
msgstr ""
"更多細節請見\\ :ref:`warning-filter`\\ 和\\ :ref:`describing-warning-"
"filters`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:511 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1030
msgid "Added regular expression support for *message* and *module*."
msgstr "新增 *message* 和 *module* 的正規表示式支援。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:517
msgid ""
"Skip the first line of the source, allowing use of non-Unix forms of ``#!"
"cmd``."
msgstr "跳過原始碼的第一列，以允許使用非 Unix 形式的 ``#!cmd``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:520
msgid ""
"This can be used to turn a Python script into a Windows batch file. "
"Similarly to adding a shebang line and setting the executable bit on Unix, "
"the extension of the Python script can be changed to ``.bat`` and the "
"following line can be added at the start of the script:"
msgstr ""
"這可用於將 Python 腳本轉換為 Windows 批次檔。與在 Unix 上加入 shebang 列並設"
"定可執行位元類似，可以將 Python 腳本的副檔名改為 ``.bat``，並在腳本開頭加入以"
"下這一列："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:525
msgid "@py -x \"%~f0\" %* & exit /b"
msgstr "@py -x \"%~f0\" %* & exit /b"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:529
msgid "Or, to specify the path to the Python interpreter explicitly:"
msgstr "或者，明確指定 Python 直譯器的路徑："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:531
msgid "@\"C:\\Path\\to\\python.exe\" -x \"%~f0\" %* & exit /b"
msgstr "@\"C:\\Path\\to\\python.exe\" -x \"%~f0\" %* & exit /b"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:535
msgid ""
"Unlike a shebang line which is a Python comment, this line is not valid "
"Python syntax, and the :option:`-x` option is needed to skip it."
msgstr ""
"與作為 Python 註解的 shebang 列不同，這一列不是有效的 Python 語法，因此需"
"要 :option:`-x` 選項來跳過它。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:541
msgid ""
"Reserved for various implementation-specific options.  CPython currently "
"defines the following possible values:"
msgstr "保留給各種實作特有的選項使用。CPython 目前定義了以下可能的值："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:544
msgid ""
"``-X faulthandler`` to enable :mod:`faulthandler`. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHONFAULTHANDLER`."
msgstr ""
"``-X faulthandler`` 用於啟用 :mod:`faulthandler`。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHONFAULTHANDLER`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:549
msgid ""
"``-X showrefcount`` to output the total reference count and number of used "
"memory blocks when the program finishes or after each statement in the "
"interactive interpreter. This only works on :ref:`debug builds <debug-"
"build>`."
msgstr ""
"``-X showrefcount`` 用於在程式結束時，或在互動式直譯器中的每個陳述式之後，輸"
"出總參照計數和已使用的記憶體區塊數量。這只在\\ :ref:`除錯建置 <debug-"
"build>`\\ 中有效。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:556
msgid ""
"``-X tracemalloc`` to start tracing Python memory allocations using "
"the :mod:`tracemalloc` module. By default, only the most recent frame is "
"stored in a traceback of a trace. Use ``-X tracemalloc=NFRAME`` to start "
"tracing with a traceback limit of *NFRAME* frames. "
"See :func:`tracemalloc.start` and :envvar:`PYTHONTRACEMALLOC` for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"``-X tracemalloc`` 用於使用 :mod:`tracemalloc` 模組開始追蹤 Python 記憶體分"
"配。預設情況下，追蹤的 traceback 中只會儲存最近的 frame。使用 ``-X "
"tracemalloc=NFRAME`` 以 *NFRAME* 個 frame 的 traceback 上限開始追蹤。更多資訊"
"請參閱 :func:`tracemalloc.start` 和 :envvar:`PYTHONTRACEMALLOC`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:565
msgid ""
"``-X int_max_str_digits`` configures the :ref:`integer string conversion "
"length limitation <int_max_str_digits>`.  See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHONINTMAXSTRDIGITS`."
msgstr ""
"``-X int_max_str_digits`` 用於設定\\ :ref:`整數字串轉換長度限制 "
"<int_max_str_digits>`。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONINTMAXSTRDIGITS`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:571
msgid ""
"``-X importtime`` to show how long each import takes. It shows module name, "
"cumulative time (including nested imports) and self time (excluding nested "
"imports).  Note that its output may be broken in multi-threaded "
"application.  Typical usage is ``python -X importtime -c 'import asyncio'``."
msgstr ""
"``-X importtime`` 用於顯示每次引入所花費的時間。它會顯示模組名稱、累計時間"
"（包括巢狀引入）和自身時間（不包括巢狀引入）。請注意，在多執行緒應用程式中，"
"其輸出可能會錯亂。典型用法是 ``python -X importtime -c 'import asyncio'``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:576
msgid ""
"``-X importtime=2`` enables additional output that indicates when an "
"imported module has already been loaded.  In such cases, the string "
"``cached`` will be printed in both time columns."
msgstr ""
"``-X importtime=2`` 會啟用額外的輸出，標示出被引入的模組已經載入過的情況。在"
"這種情況下，兩個時間欄位中都會印出字串 ``cached``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:580
msgid "See also :envvar:`PYTHONPROFILEIMPORTTIME`."
msgstr "另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONPROFILEIMPORTTIME`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:586
msgid ""
"Added ``-X importtime=2`` to also trace imports of loaded modules, and "
"reserved values other than ``1`` and ``2`` for future use."
msgstr ""
"新增 ``-X importtime=2`` 以一併追蹤已載入模組的引入，並將 ``1`` 和 ``2`` 以外"
"的值保留供未來使用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:589
msgid ""
"``-X dev``: enable :ref:`Python Development Mode <devmode>`, introducing "
"additional runtime checks that are too expensive to be enabled by default.  "
"See also :envvar:`PYTHONDEVMODE`."
msgstr ""
"``-X dev``：啟用 :ref:`Python 開發模式 <devmode>`，引入一些因成本過高而無法預"
"設啟用的額外 runtime 檢查。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONDEVMODE`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:595
msgid ""
"``-X utf8`` enables the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>`. ``-X utf8=0`` "
"explicitly disables :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>` (even when it would "
"otherwise activate automatically). See also :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8`."
msgstr ""
"``-X utf8`` 會啟用 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`。``-X utf8=0`` 會明確"
"停用 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`\\ （即使在其他情況下它會自動啟"
"用）。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:602
msgid ""
"``-X pycache_prefix=PATH`` enables writing ``.pyc`` files to a parallel tree "
"rooted at the given directory instead of to the code tree. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX`."
msgstr ""
"``-X pycache_prefix=PATH`` 會將 ``.pyc`` 檔案寫入以給定目錄為根的平行目錄樹，"
"而不是寫入程式碼樹中。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:608
msgid ""
"``-X warn_default_encoding`` issues a :class:`EncodingWarning` when the "
"locale-specific default encoding is used for opening files. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHONWARNDEFAULTENCODING`."
msgstr ""
"``-X warn_default_encoding`` 會在使用區域設定特定的預設編碼來開啟檔案時，發"
"出 :class:`EncodingWarning`。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONWARNDEFAULTENCODING`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:614
msgid ""
"``-X no_debug_ranges`` disables the inclusion of the tables mapping extra "
"location information (end line, start column offset and end column offset) "
"to every instruction in code objects. This is useful when smaller code "
"objects and pyc files are desired as well as suppressing the extra visual "
"location indicators when the interpreter displays tracebacks. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHONNODEBUGRANGES`."
msgstr ""
"``-X no_debug_ranges`` 會讓程式碼物件不包含將額外位置資訊（結束列、起始欄偏移"
"量和結束欄偏移量）對映到每個指令的表格。當你想要較小的程式碼物件和 pyc 檔案，"
"以及想在直譯器顯示 traceback 時隱藏額外的視覺化位置指示符號時，這會很有用。另"
"請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONNODEBUGRANGES`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:623
msgid ""
"``-X frozen_modules`` determines whether or not frozen modules are ignored "
"by the import machinery.  A value of ``on`` means they get imported and "
"``off`` means they are ignored.  The default is ``on`` if this is an "
"installed Python (the normal case).  If it's under development (running from "
"the source tree) then the default is ``off``. Note that the :mod:`!"
"importlib_bootstrap` and :mod:`!importlib_bootstrap_external` frozen modules "
"are always used, even if this flag is set to ``off``. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHON_FROZEN_MODULES`."
msgstr ""
"``-X frozen_modules`` 決定引入機制是否會忽略凍結模組。值為 ``on`` 表示會引入"
"它們，``off`` 表示會忽略它們。如果這是已安裝的 Python（一般情況），預設值為 "
"``on``；如果是開發中的版本（從原始碼樹執行），則預設值為 ``off``。請注意，即"
"使此旗標設為 ``off``，:mod:`!importlib_bootstrap` 和 :mod:`!"
"importlib_bootstrap_external` 凍結模組也一定會被使用。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_FROZEN_MODULES`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:634
msgid ""
"``-X perf`` enables support for the Linux ``perf`` profiler. When this "
"option is provided, the ``perf`` profiler will be able to report Python "
"calls. This option is only available on some platforms and will do nothing "
"if is not supported on the current system. The default value is \"off\". See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHONPERFSUPPORT` and :ref:`perf_profiling`."
msgstr ""
"``-X perf`` 會啟用對 Linux ``perf`` 分析器的支援。提供此選項時，``perf`` 分析"
"器將能夠回報 Python 呼叫。此選項僅在部分平台上可用，如果目前系統不支援，則不"
"會有任何作用。預設值為「off」。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONPERFSUPPORT` "
"和 :ref:`perf_profiling`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:642
msgid ""
"``-X perf_jit`` enables support for the Linux ``perf`` profiler with DWARF "
"support. When this option is provided, the ``perf`` profiler will be able to "
"report Python calls using DWARF information. This option is only available "
"on some platforms and will do nothing if is not supported on the current "
"system. The default value is \"off\". See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHON_PERF_JIT_SUPPORT` and :ref:`perf_profiling`."
msgstr ""
"``-X perf_jit`` 會啟用對 Linux ``perf`` 分析器的支援，並支援 DWARF。提供此選"
"項時，``perf`` 分析器將能夠使用 DWARF 資訊回報 Python 呼叫。此選項僅在部分平"
"台上可用，如果目前系統不支援，則不會有任何作用。預設值為「off」。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_PERF_JIT_SUPPORT` 和 :ref:`perf_profiling`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:651
msgid ""
"``-X disable-remote-debug`` disables the remote debugging support as "
"described in :pep:`768`.  This includes both the functionality to schedule "
"code for execution in another process and the functionality to receive code "
"for execution in the current process."
msgstr ""
"``-X disable-remote-debug`` 會停用 :pep:`768` 中所述的遠端除錯支援。這包括將"
"程式碼排程到另一個行程中執行的功能，以及在目前行程中接收程式碼以執行的功能。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:656
msgid ""
"This option is only available on some platforms and will do nothing if is "
"not supported on the current system. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHON_DISABLE_REMOTE_DEBUG` and :pep:`768`."
msgstr ""
"此選項僅在部分平台上可用，如果目前系統不支援，則不會有任何作用。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_DISABLE_REMOTE_DEBUG` 和 :pep:`768`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:662
msgid ""
":samp:`-X cpu_count={n}` "
"overrides :func:`os.cpu_count`, :func:`os.process_cpu_count`, "
"and :func:`multiprocessing.cpu_count`. *n* must be greater than or equal to "
"1. This option may be useful for users who need to limit CPU resources of a "
"container system. See also :envvar:`PYTHON_CPU_COUNT`. If *n* is "
"``default``, nothing is overridden."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X cpu_count={n}` 會覆"
"寫 :func:`os.cpu_count`、:func:`os.process_cpu_count` "
"和 :func:`multiprocessing.cpu_count`。*n* 必須大於或等於 1。對於需要限制容器"
"系統 CPU 資源的使用者，此選項可能很有用。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_CPU_COUNT`。如果 *n* 為 ``default``，則不會覆寫任何東西。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:671
msgid ""
":samp:`-X presite={module}` or :samp:`-X presite={module:func}` specifies an "
"entry point that should be executed before the :mod:`site` module is "
"executed and before the :mod:`__main__` module exists.  Therefore, the "
"imported module isn't :mod:`__main__`. This can be used to execute code "
"early during Python initialization. Python needs to be :ref:`built in debug "
"mode <debug-build>` for this option to exist.  See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHON_PRESITE`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X presite={module}` 或 :samp:`-X presite={module:func}` 會指定一個進"
"入點，它會在 :mod:`site` 模組執行之前，以及 :mod:`__main__` 模組存在之前執"
"行。因此，被引入的模組不是 :mod:`__main__`。這可用於在 Python 初始化的早期階"
"段執行程式碼。Python 必須\\ :ref:`以除錯模式建置 <debug-build>`\\ 才會有此選"
"項。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_PRESITE`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:679 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1479
msgid "Accept also ``module:func`` entry point format."
msgstr "也接受 ``module:func`` 進入點格式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:684
msgid ""
":samp:`-X gil={0,1}` forces the GIL to be disabled or enabled, respectively. "
"Setting to ``0`` is only available in builds configured with :option:`--"
"disable-gil`. See also :envvar:`PYTHON_GIL` and :ref:`whatsnew313-free-"
"threaded-cpython`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X gil={0,1}` 會分別強制停用或啟用 GIL。只有在以 :option:`--disable-"
"gil` 配置的建置中才能設為 ``0``。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_GIL` "
"和 :ref:`whatsnew313-free-threaded-cpython`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:691
msgid ""
":samp:`-X thread_inherit_context={0,1}` causes :class:`~threading.Thread` "
"to, by default, use a copy of context of the caller of ``Thread.start()`` "
"when starting.  Otherwise, threads will start with an empty context.  If "
"unset, the value of this option defaults to ``1`` on free-threaded builds "
"and to ``0`` otherwise.  See also :envvar:`PYTHON_THREAD_INHERIT_CONTEXT`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X thread_inherit_context={0,1}` 會使 :class:`~threading.Thread` 在啟"
"動時預設使用 ``Thread.start()`` 呼叫者的情境副本。否則，執行緒會以空的情境啟"
"動。如果未設定，此選項的值在自由執行緒建置上預設為 ``1``，在其他建置上預設為 "
"``0``。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_THREAD_INHERIT_CONTEXT`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:700
msgid ""
":samp:`-X context_aware_warnings={0,1}` causes "
"the :class:`warnings.catch_warnings` context manager to use "
"a :class:`~contextvars.ContextVar` to store warnings filter state.  If "
"unset, the value of this option defaults to ``1`` on free-threaded builds "
"and to ``0`` otherwise.  See also :envvar:`PYTHON_CONTEXT_AWARE_WARNINGS`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X context_aware_warnings={0,1}` 會"
"使 :class:`warnings.catch_warnings` 情境管理器使"
"用 :class:`~contextvars.ContextVar` 來儲存警告過濾器狀態。如果未設定，此選項"
"的值在自由執行緒建置上預設為 ``1``，在其他建置上預設為 ``0``。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_CONTEXT_AWARE_WARNINGS`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:708
msgid ""
":samp:`-X pathconfig_warnings={0,1}` if true (``1``) then :ref:`sys-path-"
"init` is allowed to log warnings into stderr. If false (``0``) suppress "
"these warnings. Set to true by default. See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHON_PATHCONFIG_WARNINGS`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X pathconfig_warnings={0,1}` 若為真 (``1``)，則 :ref:`sys-path-"
"init`\\ 過程中可以將警告記錄到 stderr。若為假 (``0``)，則抑制這些警告。預設為"
"真。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_PATHCONFIG_WARNINGS`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:715
msgid ""
":samp:`-X tlbc={0,1}` enables (1, the default) or disables (0) thread-local "
"bytecode in builds configured with :option:`--disable-gil`.  When disabled, "
"this also disables the specializing interpreter.  See "
"also :envvar:`PYTHON_TLBC`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X tlbc={0,1}` 會在以 :option:`--disable-gil` 配置的建置中啟用 (1) 或"
"停用 (0) 執行緒區域位元組碼 (thread-local bytecode)（預設為啟用）。停用時，也"
"會一併停用特化直譯器 (specializing interpreter)。另請參"
"閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_TLBC`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:722
msgid ""
":samp:`-X lazy_imports={all,normal}` controls lazy import behavior. ``all`` "
"makes all imports lazy by default, and ``normal`` (the default) respects the "
"``lazy`` keyword in source code. See also :envvar:`PYTHON_LAZY_IMPORTS`."
msgstr ""
":samp:`-X lazy_imports={all,normal}` 控制惰性引入 (lazy import) 的行為。"
"``all`` 會讓所有引入預設都成為惰性引入，而 ``normal``\\ （預設值）則會遵循原"
"始碼中的 ``lazy`` 關鍵字。另請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHON_LAZY_IMPORTS`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:729
msgid ""
"It also allows passing arbitrary values and retrieving them through "
"the :data:`sys._xoptions` dictionary."
msgstr "它也允許傳入任意值，並透過 :data:`sys._xoptions` 字典取得這些值。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:734
msgid "Removed the ``-X showalloccount`` option."
msgstr "移除 ``-X showalloccount`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:737
msgid "Removed the ``-X oldparser`` option."
msgstr "移除 ``-X oldparser`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:742
msgid ""
":option:`!-J` is no longer reserved for use by Jython_, and now has no "
"special meaning."
msgstr ":option:`!-J` 不再保留給 Jython_ 使用，現在也沒有特殊意義。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:750
msgid "Controlling color"
msgstr "控制顏色"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:752
msgid ""
"The Python interpreter is configured by default to use colors to highlight "
"output in certain situations such as when displaying tracebacks. This "
"behavior can be controlled by setting different environment variables."
msgstr ""
"Python 直譯器預設會在某些情況下（例如顯示 traceback 時）使用顏色來突顯輸出。"
"此行為可以透過設定不同的環境變數來控制。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:756
msgid ""
"Setting the environment variable ``TERM`` to ``dumb`` will disable color."
msgstr "將環境變數 ``TERM`` 設為 ``dumb`` 會停用顏色。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:758
msgid ""
"If the |FORCE_COLOR|_ environment variable is set, then color will be "
"enabled regardless of the value of TERM. This is useful on CI systems which "
"aren’t terminals but can still display ANSI escape sequences."
msgstr ""
"如果設定了 |FORCE_COLOR|_ 環境變數，則無論 TERM 的值為何都會啟用顏色。這對於"
"不是終端機但仍可顯示 ANSI 跳脫序列的 CI 系統很有用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:762
msgid ""
"If the |NO_COLOR|_ environment variable is set, Python will disable all "
"color in the output. This takes precedence over ``FORCE_COLOR``."
msgstr ""
"如果設定了 |NO_COLOR|_ 環境變數，Python 會停用輸出中的所有顏色。此變數優先於 "
"``FORCE_COLOR``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:765
msgid ""
"All these environment variables are used also by other tools to control "
"color output. To control the color output only in the Python interpreter, "
"the :envvar:`PYTHON_COLORS` environment variable can be used. This variable "
"takes precedence over ``NO_COLOR``, which in turn takes precedence over "
"``FORCE_COLOR``."
msgstr ""
"所有這些環境變數也會被其他工具用來控制顏色輸出。若只想控制 Python 直譯器中的"
"顏色輸出，可以使用 :envvar:`PYTHON_COLORS` 環境變數。此變數優先於 "
"``NO_COLOR``，而後者又優先於 ``FORCE_COLOR``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:775
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "環境變數"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:777
msgid ""
"These environment variables influence Python's behavior, they are processed "
"before the command-line switches other than -E or -I.  It is customary that "
"command-line switches override environmental variables where there is a "
"conflict."
msgstr ""
"這些環境變數會影響 Python 的行為，它們會在 -E 或 -I 以外的命令列開關之前被處"
"理。依照慣例，發生衝突時命令列開關會覆寫環境變數。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:784
msgid ""
"Change the location of the standard Python libraries.  By default, the "
"libraries are searched in :file:`{prefix}/lib/python{version}` "
"and :file:`{exec_prefix}/lib/python{version}`, where :file:`{prefix}` "
"and :file:`{exec_prefix}` are installation-dependent directories, both "
"defaulting to :file:`/usr/local`."
msgstr ""
"變更標準 Python 函式庫的位置。預設情況下，函式庫會在 :file:`{prefix}/lib/"
"python{version}` 和 :file:`{exec_prefix}/lib/python{version}` 中搜尋，其"
"中 :file:`{prefix}` 和 :file:`{exec_prefix}` 是與安裝相關的目錄，兩者預設皆"
"為 :file:`/usr/local`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:790
msgid ""
"When :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` is set to a single directory, its value replaces "
"both :file:`{prefix}` and :file:`{exec_prefix}`.  To specify different "
"values for these, set :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` to :file:`{prefix}:{exec_prefix}`."
msgstr ""
"當 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` 設為單一目錄時，其值會同時取代 :file:`{prefix}` "
"和 :file:`{exec_prefix}`。若要為兩者指定不同的值，請將 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` "
"設為 :file:`{prefix}:{exec_prefix}`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:797
msgid ""
"Augment the default search path for module files.  The format is the same as "
"the shell's :envvar:`PATH`: one or more directory pathnames separated "
"by :data:`os.pathsep` (e.g. colons on Unix or semicolons on Windows). Non-"
"existent directories are silently ignored."
msgstr ""
"擴增模組檔案的預設搜尋路徑。格式與 shell 的 :envvar:`PATH` 相同：一或多個"
"以 :data:`os.pathsep` 分隔的目錄路徑名稱（例如在 Unix 上為冒號，在 Windows 上"
"為分號）。不存在的目錄會被默默忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:802
msgid ""
"In addition to normal directories, individual :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` entries "
"may refer to zipfiles containing pure Python modules (in either source or "
"compiled form). Extension modules cannot be imported from zipfiles."
msgstr ""
"除了一般目錄之外，個別的 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` 項目也可以指向包含純 Python 模"
"組（原始碼或編譯後形式皆可）的 zip 檔案。擴充模組無法從 zip 檔案中引入。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:806
msgid ""
"The default search path is installation dependent, but generally begins "
"with :file:`{prefix}/lib/python{version}` (see :envvar:`PYTHONHOME` above).  "
"It is *always* appended to :envvar:`PYTHONPATH`."
msgstr ""
"預設搜尋路徑與安裝方式有關，但通常以 :file:`{prefix}/lib/python{version}` 開"
"頭（請參閱上方的 :envvar:`PYTHONHOME`）。它\\ *一定*\\ 會被附加"
"到 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` 之後。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:810
msgid ""
"An additional directory will be inserted in the search path in front "
"of :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` as described above under :ref:`using-on-interface-"
"options`. The search path can be manipulated from within a Python program as "
"the variable :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
"如上方\\ :ref:`using-on-interface-options`\\ 中所述，會有一個額外的目錄被插入"
"到搜尋路徑中 :envvar:`PYTHONPATH` 的前面。搜尋路徑可以在 Python 程式中透過變"
"數 :data:`sys.path` 來操作。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:818
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string, don't prepend a potentially unsafe "
"path :data:`sys._path0` to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，則不會將可能不安全的路徑 :data:`sys._path0` 加"
"到 :data:`sys.path` 的開頭。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:821
msgid "See also the :option:`-P` option."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-P` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:828
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string, it overrides "
"the :data:`sys.platlibdir` value."
msgstr "如果設為非空字串，則會覆寫 :data:`sys.platlibdir` 的值。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:836
msgid ""
"If this is the name of a readable file, the Python commands in that file are "
"executed before the first prompt is displayed in interactive mode.  The file "
"is executed in the same namespace where interactive commands are executed so "
"that objects defined or imported in it can be used without qualification in "
"the interactive session.  You can also change the prompts :data:`sys.ps1` "
"and :data:`sys.ps2` and the hook :data:`sys.__interactivehook__` in this "
"file."
msgstr ""
"如果這是一個可讀取檔案的名稱，則該檔案中的 Python 命令會在互動模式中顯示第一"
"個提示字元之前被執行。該檔案會在與互動式命令相同的命名空間中執行，因此在其中"
"定義或引入的物件可以在互動式工作階段中不加限定地使用。你也可以在此檔案中變更"
"提示字元 :data:`sys.ps1` 和 :data:`sys.ps2`，以及 "
"hook :data:`sys.__interactivehook__`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:843 ../../using/cmdline.rst:845
msgid ""
"Raises an :ref:`auditing event <auditing>` ``cpython.run_startup`` with the "
"filename as the argument when called on startup."
msgstr ""
"在啟動時被呼叫時，引發一個附帶檔案名稱作為引數的\\ :ref:`稽核事件 "
"<auditing>` ``cpython.run_startup``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:851
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string it is equivalent to specifying "
"the :option:`-O` option.  If set to an integer, it is equivalent to "
"specifying :option:`-O` multiple times."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，則等同於指定 :option:`-O` 選項。如果設為整數，則等同於多次"
"指定 :option:`-O`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:858
msgid ""
"If this is set, it names a callable using dotted-path notation.  The module "
"containing the callable will be imported and then the callable will be run "
"by the default implementation of :func:`sys.breakpointhook` which itself is "
"called by built-in :func:`breakpoint`.  If not set, or set to the empty "
"string, it is equivalent to the value \"pdb.set_trace\".  Setting this to "
"the string \"0\" causes the default implementation "
"of :func:`sys.breakpointhook` to do nothing but return immediately."
msgstr ""
"如果有設定，其值會以點分路徑表示法指名一個可呼叫物件。包含該可呼叫物件的模組"
"會被引入，接著該可呼叫物件會由 :func:`sys.breakpointhook`\\ （它本身由內建"
"的 :func:`breakpoint` 呼叫）的預設實作執行。如果未設定或設為空字串，則等同於"
"值「pdb.set_trace」。將其設為字串「0」會使 :func:`sys.breakpointhook` 的預設"
"實作不做任何事，立即回傳。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:870
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string it is equivalent to specifying "
"the :option:`-d` option.  If set to an integer, it is equivalent to "
"specifying :option:`-d` multiple times."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，則等同於指定 :option:`-d` 選項。如果設為整數，則等同於多次"
"指定 :option:`-d`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:874
msgid ""
"This environment variable requires a :ref:`debug build of Python <debug-"
"build>`, otherwise it's ignored."
msgstr ""
"此環境變數需要\\ :ref:`除錯建置的 Python <debug-build>`，否則會被忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:880
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string it is equivalent to specifying "
"the :option:`-i` option."
msgstr "如果設為非空字串，則等同於指定 :option:`-i` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:883
msgid ""
"This variable can also be modified by Python code using :data:`os.environ` "
"to force inspect mode on program termination."
msgstr ""
"此變數也可以由 Python 程式碼透過 :data:`os.environ` 修改，以在程式終止時強制"
"進入檢查模式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:888
msgid "(also 3.11.10, 3.10.15, 3.9.20, and 3.8.20) Emits audit events."
msgstr "（也包括 3.11.10、3.10.15、3.9.20 及 3.8.20）發出稽核事件。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:891
msgid ""
"Uses PyREPL if possible, in which case :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` is also "
"executed. Emits audit events."
msgstr ""
"可能的話使用 PyREPL，在這種情況下 :envvar:`PYTHONSTARTUP` 也會被執行。發出稽"
"核事件。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:898
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string it is equivalent to specifying "
"the :option:`-u` option."
msgstr "如果設為非空字串，則等同於指定 :option:`-u` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:904
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string it is equivalent to specifying "
"the :option:`-v` option.  If set to an integer, it is equivalent to "
"specifying :option:`-v` multiple times."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，則等同於指定 :option:`-v` 選項。如果設為整數，則等同於多次"
"指定 :option:`-v`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:911
msgid ""
"If this is set, Python ignores case in :keyword:`import` statements.  This "
"only works on Windows and macOS."
msgstr ""
"如果有設定，Python 會在 :keyword:`import` 陳述式中忽略大小寫。這只在 Windows "
"和 macOS 上有效。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:917
msgid ""
"If this is set to a non-empty string, Python won't try to write ``.pyc`` "
"files on the import of source modules.  This is equivalent to specifying "
"the :option:`-B` option."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，Python 在引入原始碼模組時不會嘗試寫入 ``.pyc`` 檔案。這等同"
"於指定 :option:`-B` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:924
msgid ""
"If this is set, Python will write ``.pyc`` files in a mirror directory tree "
"at this path, instead of in ``__pycache__`` directories within the source "
"tree. This is equivalent to specifying the :option:`-X` "
"``pycache_prefix=PATH`` option."
msgstr ""
"如果有設定，Python 會將 ``.pyc`` 檔案寫入位於此路徑的鏡像目錄樹中，而不是寫入"
"原始碼樹中的 ``__pycache__`` 目錄。這等同於指定 :option:`-X` "
"``pycache_prefix=PATH`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:934
msgid ""
"If this variable is not set or set to ``random``, a random value is used to "
"seed the hashes of str and bytes objects."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數未設定或設為 ``random``，則會使用一個隨機值作為 str 和 bytes 物件雜"
"湊的種子。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:937
msgid ""
"If :envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` is set to an integer value, it is used as a "
"fixed seed for generating the hash() of the types covered by the hash "
"randomization."
msgstr ""
"如果 :envvar:`PYTHONHASHSEED` 設為整數值，它會被用作固定種子，來產生雜湊隨機"
"化所涵蓋之型別的 hash()。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:941
msgid ""
"Its purpose is to allow repeatable hashing, such as for selftests for the "
"interpreter itself, or to allow a cluster of python processes to share hash "
"values."
msgstr ""
"其目的是允許可重複的雜湊，例如用於直譯器本身的自我測試，或讓一群 Python 行程"
"共享雜湊值。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:945
msgid ""
"The integer must be a decimal number in the range [0,4294967295].  "
"Specifying the value 0 will disable hash randomization."
msgstr ""
"該整數必須是範圍 [0,4294967295] 內的十進位數字。指定值 0 會停用雜湊隨機化。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:952
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to an integer, it is used to configure the "
"interpreter's global :ref:`integer string conversion length limitation "
"<int_max_str_digits>`."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為整數，它會被用來設定直譯器全域的\\ :ref:`整數字串轉換長度限制 "
"<int_max_str_digits>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:960
msgid ""
"If this is set before running the interpreter, it overrides the encoding "
"used for stdin/stdout/stderr, in the syntax ``encodingname:errorhandler``.  "
"Both the ``encodingname`` and the ``:errorhandler`` parts are optional and "
"have the same meaning as in :func:`str.encode`."
msgstr ""
"如果在執行直譯器之前有設定，它會以 ``encodingname:errorhandler`` 語法覆寫 "
"stdin/stdout/stderr 所使用的編碼。``encodingname`` 和 ``:errorhandler`` 部分"
"都是可選的，且與 :func:`str.encode` 中的意義相同。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:965
msgid ""
"For stderr, the ``:errorhandler`` part is ignored; the handler will always "
"be ``'backslashreplace'``."
msgstr ""
"對於 stderr，``:errorhandler`` 部分會被忽略；處理器一律為 "
"``'backslashreplace'``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:968
msgid "The ``encodingname`` part is now optional."
msgstr "``encodingname`` 部分現在是可選的。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:971
msgid ""
"On Windows, the encoding specified by this variable is ignored for "
"interactive console buffers unless :envvar:`PYTHONLEGACYWINDOWSSTDIO` is "
"also specified. Files and pipes redirected through the standard streams are "
"not affected."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，除非同時指定了 :envvar:`PYTHONLEGACYWINDOWSSTDIO`，否則互動式"
"主控台緩衝區會忽略此變數所指定的編碼。透過標準串流重新導向的檔案和管道則不受"
"影響。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:978
msgid ""
"This is equivalent to the :option:`-s` option.  If this is set, Python won't "
"add the :data:`user site-packages directory <site.USER_SITE>` "
"to :data:`sys.path`."
msgstr ""
"這等同於 :option:`-s` 選項。如果有設定此變數，Python 不會將\\ :data:`使用者 "
"site-packages 目錄 <site.USER_SITE>`\\ 加入 :data:`sys.path`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:989
msgid ""
"Defines the :data:`user base directory <site.USER_BASE>`, which is used to "
"compute the path of the :data:`user site-packages directory "
"<site.USER_SITE>` and :ref:`installation paths <sysconfig-user-scheme>` for "
"``python -m pip install --user``."
msgstr ""
"定義\\ :data:`使用者基礎目錄 <site.USER_BASE>`，它用於計算\\ :data:`使用者 "
"site-packages 目錄 <site.USER_SITE>`\\ 的路徑，以及 ``python -m pip install "
"--user`` 的\\ :ref:`安裝路徑 <sysconfig-user-scheme>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:994
msgid ""
"To disable the user site-packages, see :envvar:`PYTHONNOUSERSITE` or "
"the :option:`-s` option."
msgstr ""
"若要停用使用者 site-packages，請參閱 :envvar:`PYTHONNOUSERSITE` 或 :option:`-"
"s` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1004
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set, ``sys.argv[0]`` will be set to its "
"value instead of the value got through the C runtime.  Only works on macOS."
msgstr ""
"如果設定了此環境變數，``sys.argv[0]`` 會被設為其值，而不是透過 C runtime 取得"
"的值。僅在 macOS 上有效。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1010
msgid ""
"This is equivalent to the :option:`-W` option. If set to a comma separated "
"string, it is equivalent to specifying :option:`-W` multiple times, with "
"filters later in the list taking precedence over those earlier in the list."
msgstr ""
"這等同於 :option:`-W` 選項。如果設為以逗號分隔的字串，則等同於多次指"
"定 :option:`-W`，其中串列中較後面的過濾器優先於較前面的過濾器。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1019
msgid ""
"PYTHONWARNINGS=default  # Warn once per call location\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=error    # Convert to exceptions\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=always   # Warn every time\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=all      # Same as PYTHONWARNINGS=always\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=module   # Warn once per calling module\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=once     # Warn once per Python process\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=ignore   # Never warn"
msgstr ""
"PYTHONWARNINGS=default  # 每個呼叫位置警告一次\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=error    # 轉換為例外\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=always   # 每次都警告\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=all      # 與 PYTHONWARNINGS=always 相同\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=module   # 每個發出呼叫的模組警告一次\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=once     # 每個 Python 行程警告一次\n"
"PYTHONWARNINGS=ignore   # 永不警告"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1036
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set to a non-empty "
"string, :func:`faulthandler.enable` is called at startup: install a handler "
"for :const:`~signal.SIGSEGV`, :const:`~signal.SIGFPE`, :const:`~signal.SIGABRT`, :const:`~signal.SIGBUS` "
"and :const:`~signal.SIGILL` signals to dump the Python traceback. This is "
"equivalent to :option:`-X` ``faulthandler`` option."
msgstr ""
"如果此環境變數設為非空字串，則會在啟動時呼叫 :func:`faulthandler.enable`："
"為 :const:`~signal.SIGSEGV`、:const:`~signal.SIGFPE`、:const:`~signal.SIGABRT`、:const:`~signal.SIGBUS` "
"和 :const:`~signal.SIGILL` 訊號安裝一個處理器，以傾印 Python traceback。這等"
"同於 :option:`-X` ``faulthandler`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1048
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set to a non-empty string, start tracing "
"Python memory allocations using the :mod:`tracemalloc` module. The value of "
"the variable is the maximum number of frames stored in a traceback of a "
"trace. For example, ``PYTHONTRACEMALLOC=1`` stores only the most recent "
"frame. See the :func:`tracemalloc.start` function for more information. This "
"is equivalent to setting the :option:`-X` ``tracemalloc`` option."
msgstr ""
"如果此環境變數設為非空字串，則會使用 :mod:`tracemalloc` 模組開始追蹤 Python "
"記憶體分配。此變數的值是追蹤的 traceback 中所儲存的最大 frame 數量。例如，"
"``PYTHONTRACEMALLOC=1`` 只會儲存最近的 frame。更多資訊請參"
"閱 :func:`tracemalloc.start` 函式。這等同於設定 :option:`-X` ``tracemalloc`` "
"選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1061
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set to ``1``, Python will show how long each "
"import takes. If set to ``2``, Python will include output for imported "
"modules that have already been loaded. This is equivalent to setting "
"the :option:`-X` ``importtime`` option."
msgstr ""
"如果此環境變數設為 ``1``，Python 會顯示每次引入所花費的時間。如果設為 ``2``，"
"Python 也會輸出已載入過之被引入模組的資訊。這等同於設定 :option:`-X` "
"``importtime`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1070
msgid ""
"Added ``PYTHONPROFILEIMPORTTIME=2`` to also trace imports of loaded modules."
msgstr "新增 ``PYTHONPROFILEIMPORTTIME=2`` 以一併追蹤已載入模組的引入。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1075
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set to a non-empty string, enable "
"the :ref:`debug mode <asyncio-debug-mode>` of the :mod:`asyncio` module."
msgstr ""
"如果此環境變數設為非空字串，則啟用 :mod:`asyncio` 模組的\\ :ref:`除錯模式 "
"<asyncio-debug-mode>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1083
msgid "Set the Python memory allocators and/or install debug hooks."
msgstr "設定 Python 記憶體分配器和/或安裝除錯 hook。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1085
msgid "Set the family of memory allocators used by Python:"
msgstr "設定 Python 所使用的記憶體分配器系列："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1087
msgid ""
"``default``: use the :ref:`default memory allocators <default-memory-"
"allocators>`."
msgstr ""
"``default``：使用\\ :ref:`預設記憶體分配器 <default-memory-allocators>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1089
msgid ""
"``malloc``: use the :c:func:`malloc` function of the C library for all "
"domains "
"(:c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_RAW`, :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM`, :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_OBJ`)."
msgstr ""
"``malloc``：對所有 domain"
"（:c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_RAW`、:c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM`、:c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_OBJ`）"
"使用 C 函式庫的 :c:func:`malloc` 函式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1092
msgid ""
"``pymalloc``: use the :ref:`pymalloc allocator <pymalloc>` "
"for :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM` and :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_OBJ` domains and "
"use the :c:func:`malloc` function for the :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_RAW` domain."
msgstr ""
"``pymalloc``：對 :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM` 和 :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_OBJ` "
"domain 使用 :ref:`pymalloc 分配器 <pymalloc>`，並"
"對 :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_RAW` domain 使用 :c:func:`malloc` 函式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1095
msgid ""
"``mimalloc``: use the :ref:`mimalloc allocator <mimalloc>` "
"for :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM` and :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_OBJ` domains and "
"use the :c:func:`malloc` function for the :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_RAW` domain."
msgstr ""
"``mimalloc``：對 :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_MEM` 和 :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_OBJ` "
"domain 使用 :ref:`mimalloc 分配器 <mimalloc>`，並"
"對 :c:macro:`PYMEM_DOMAIN_RAW` domain 使用 :c:func:`malloc` 函式。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1099
msgid "Install :ref:`debug hooks <pymem-debug-hooks>`:"
msgstr "安裝\\ :ref:`除錯 hook <pymem-debug-hooks>`："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1101
msgid ""
"``debug``: install debug hooks on top of the :ref:`default memory allocators "
"<default-memory-allocators>`."
msgstr ""
"``debug``：在\\ :ref:`預設記憶體分配器 <default-memory-allocators>`\\ 之上安"
"裝除錯 hook。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1103
msgid "``malloc_debug``: same as ``malloc`` but also install debug hooks."
msgstr "``malloc_debug``：與 ``malloc`` 相同，但也會安裝除錯 hook。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1104
msgid "``pymalloc_debug``: same as ``pymalloc`` but also install debug hooks."
msgstr "``pymalloc_debug``：與 ``pymalloc`` 相同，但也會安裝除錯 hook。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1105
msgid "``mimalloc_debug``: same as ``mimalloc`` but also install debug hooks."
msgstr "``mimalloc_debug``：與 ``mimalloc`` 相同，但也會安裝除錯 hook。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1109
msgid ""
"In the :term:`free-threaded <free threading>` build, the ``malloc``, "
"``malloc_debug``, ``pymalloc``, and ``pymalloc_debug`` values are not "
"supported.  Only ``default``, ``debug``, ``mimalloc``, and "
"``mimalloc_debug`` are accepted."
msgstr ""
"在\\ :term:`自由執行緒 <free threading>`\\ 建置中，不支援 ``malloc``、"
"``malloc_debug``、``pymalloc`` 和 ``pymalloc_debug`` 這些值。只接受 "
"``default``、``debug``、``mimalloc`` 和 ``mimalloc_debug``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1116
msgid "Added the ``\"default\"`` allocator."
msgstr "新增 ``\"default\"`` 分配器。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1122
msgid ""
"If set to a non-empty string, Python will print statistics of "
"the :ref:`pymalloc memory allocator <pymalloc>` or the :ref:`mimalloc memory "
"allocator <mimalloc>` (whichever is in use) every time a new object arena is "
"created, and on shutdown."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，Python 會在每次建立新的物件 arena 時以及關閉時，印"
"出 :ref:`pymalloc 記憶體分配器 <pymalloc>`\\ 或 :ref:`mimalloc 記憶體分配器 "
"<mimalloc>`\\ （取決於使用的是哪一個）的統計資訊。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1127
msgid ""
"This variable is ignored if the :envvar:`PYTHONMALLOC` environment variable "
"is used to force the :c:func:`malloc` allocator of the C library, or if "
"Python is configured without both ``pymalloc`` and ``mimalloc`` support."
msgstr ""
"如果使用 :envvar:`PYTHONMALLOC` 環境變數強制使用 C 函式庫的 :c:func:`malloc` "
"分配器，或者 Python 在配置時 ``pymalloc`` 和 ``mimalloc`` 兩者的支援皆未啟"
"用，則此變數會被忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1131
msgid ""
"This variable can now also be used on Python compiled in release mode. It "
"now has no effect if set to an empty string."
msgstr ""
"此變數現在也可以用於以發布模式編譯的 Python。如果設為空字串，現在不會有任何作"
"用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1138
msgid ""
"If set to a non-zero integer, enable huge page support for :ref:`pymalloc "
"<pymalloc>` arenas.  Set to ``0`` or unset to disable. Python must be "
"compiled with :option:`--with-pymalloc-hugepages` for this variable to have "
"any effect."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非零整數，則為 :ref:`pymalloc <pymalloc>` 的 arena 啟用大型分頁 "
"(huge page) 支援。設為 ``0`` 或不設定則停用。Python 必須以 :option:`--with-"
"pymalloc-hugepages` 編譯，此變數才會有作用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1143
msgid ""
"When enabled, arena allocation uses ``MAP_HUGETLB`` (Linux) or "
"``MEM_LARGE_PAGES`` (Windows) with automatic fallback to regular pages if "
"huge pages are not available."
msgstr ""
"啟用時，arena 的分配會使用 ``MAP_HUGETLB`` (Linux) 或 ``MEM_LARGE_PAGES`` "
"(Windows)，如果沒有可用的大型分頁，則會自動退回使用一般分頁。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1149
msgid ""
"On Linux, if the huge-page pool is exhausted, page faults — including copy-"
"on-write faults triggered by :func:`os.fork` — deliver ``SIGBUS`` and kill "
"the process.  Only enable this in environments where the huge-page pool is "
"properly sized and fork-safety is not a concern."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，如果大型分頁池已耗盡，分頁錯誤（包括由 :func:`os.fork` 觸發的寫"
"入時複製錯誤）會傳送 ``SIGBUS`` 並終止行程。請只在大型分頁池大小配置得當、且"
"不需顧慮 fork 安全性的環境中啟用此功能。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1154
msgid ""
"On Windows you need a special privilege. See the `Windows documentation for "
"large pages <https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/memory/large-page-"
"support>`_ for details. Python will fail on startup if the required "
"privilege `SeLockMemoryPrivilege <https://learn.microsoft.com/previous-"
"versions/windows/it-pro/windows-10/security/threat-protection/security-"
"policy-settings/lock-pages-in-memory>`_ is not held by the user."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，你需要一項特殊權限。詳情請參閱 `Windows 的大型分頁文件 "
"<https://learn.microsoft.com/windows/win32/memory/large-page-support>`_。如果"
"使用者沒有所需的 `SeLockMemoryPrivilege <https://learn.microsoft.com/"
"previous-versions/windows/it-pro/windows-10/security/threat-protection/"
"security-policy-settings/lock-pages-in-memory>`_ 權限，Python 會在啟動時失"
"敗。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1167
msgid ""
"If set to a non-empty string, the default :term:`filesystem encoding and "
"error handler` mode will revert to their pre-3.6 values of 'mbcs' and "
"'replace', respectively.  Otherwise, the new defaults 'utf-8' and "
"'surrogatepass' are used."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，預設的\\ :term:`檔案系統編碼和錯誤處理函式 <filesystem "
"encoding and error handler>`\\ 模式會分別恢復為 3.6 之前的值「mbcs」和"
"「replace」。否則會使用新的預設值「utf-8」和「surrogatepass」。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1172
msgid ""
"This may also be enabled at runtime "
"with :func:`sys._enablelegacywindowsfsencoding`."
msgstr ""
"這也可以在 runtime 透過 :func:`sys._enablelegacywindowsfsencoding` 啟用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1175 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1189
#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1240
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "可用性"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1177
msgid "See :pep:`529` for more details."
msgstr "更多細節請見 :pep:`529`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1182
msgid ""
"If set to a non-empty string, does not use the new console reader and "
"writer. This means that Unicode characters will be encoded according to the "
"active console code page, rather than using utf-8."
msgstr ""
"如果設為非空字串，則不使用新的主控台讀取器和寫入器。這表示 Unicode 字元將依照"
"使用中的主控台碼頁進行編碼，而不是使用 utf-8。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1186
msgid ""
"This variable is ignored if the standard streams are redirected (to files or "
"pipes) rather than referring to console buffers."
msgstr ""
"如果標準串流被重新導向（到檔案或管道），而不是指向主控台緩衝區，則此變數會被"
"忽略。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1196
msgid ""
"If set to the value ``0``, causes the main Python command line application "
"to skip coercing the legacy ASCII-based C and POSIX locales to a more "
"capable UTF-8 based alternative."
msgstr ""
"如果設為 ``0`` 值，會使主要的 Python 命令列應用程式跳過強制轉換，不將舊有且基"
"於 ASCII 的 C 和 POSIX 區域設定轉換為功能更完整、基於 UTF-8 的替代區域設定。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1200
msgid ""
"If this variable is *not* set (or is set to a value other than ``0``), the "
"``LC_ALL`` locale override environment variable is also not set, and the "
"current locale reported for the ``LC_CTYPE`` category is either the default "
"``C`` locale, or else the explicitly ASCII-based ``POSIX`` locale, then the "
"Python CLI will attempt to configure the following locales for the "
"``LC_CTYPE`` category in the order listed before loading the interpreter "
"runtime:"
msgstr ""
"如果\\ *未*\\ 設定此變數（或設為 ``0`` 以外的值），``LC_ALL`` 區域設定覆寫環"
"境變數也未設定，且 ``LC_CTYPE`` 類別所回報的目前區域設定是預設的 ``C`` 區域設"
"定，或是明確基於 ASCII 的 ``POSIX`` 區域設定，則 Python CLI 會在載入直譯器 "
"runtime 之前，依照列出的順序嘗試為 ``LC_CTYPE`` 類別設定以下區域設定："

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1208
msgid "``C.UTF-8``"
msgstr "``C.UTF-8``"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1209
msgid "``C.utf8``"
msgstr "``C.utf8``"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1210
msgid "``UTF-8``"
msgstr "``UTF-8``"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1212
msgid ""
"If setting one of these locale categories succeeds, then the ``LC_CTYPE`` "
"environment variable will also be set accordingly in the current process "
"environment before the Python runtime is initialized. This ensures that in "
"addition to being seen by both the interpreter itself and other locale-aware "
"components running in the same process (such as the GNU ``readline`` "
"library), the updated setting is also seen in subprocesses (regardless of "
"whether or not those processes are running a Python interpreter), as well as "
"in operations that query the environment rather than the current C locale "
"(such as Python's own :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale`)."
msgstr ""
"如果成功設定了其中一個區域設定類別，則在 Python runtime 初始化之前，"
"``LC_CTYPE`` 環境變數也會在目前行程的環境中相應地設定。這能確保更新後的設定不"
"只對直譯器本身，以及在同一行程中執行、能感知區域設定的其他元件（例如 GNU "
"``readline`` 函式庫）可見，對子行程（無論這些行程是否正在執行 Python 直譯"
"器），以及查詢環境而非目前 C 區域設定的操作（例如 Python 自己"
"的 :func:`locale.getdefaultlocale`）也同樣可見。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1222
msgid ""
"Configuring one of these locales (either explicitly or via the above "
"implicit locale coercion) automatically enables the "
"``surrogateescape`` :ref:`error handler <error-handlers>` "
"for :data:`sys.stdin` and :data:`sys.stdout` (:data:`sys.stderr` continues "
"to use ``backslashreplace`` as it does in any other locale). This stream "
"handling behavior can be overridden using :envvar:`PYTHONIOENCODING` as "
"usual."
msgstr ""
"設定其中一個區域設定（無論是明確設定，或是透過上述隱式的區域設定強制轉換 "
"(locale coercion)）會自動為 :data:`sys.stdin` 和 :data:`sys.stdout` 啟用 "
"``surrogateescape`` :ref:`錯誤處理器 <error-handlers>`\\ "
"（:data:`sys.stderr` 會繼續使用 ``backslashreplace``，就如同在其他任何區域設"
"定中一樣）。此串流處理行為可以照常使用 :envvar:`PYTHONIOENCODING` 覆寫。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1229
msgid ""
"For debugging purposes, setting ``PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE=warn`` will cause "
"Python to emit warning messages on ``stderr`` if either the locale coercion "
"activates, or else if a locale that *would* have triggered coercion is still "
"active when the Python runtime is initialized."
msgstr ""
"為了除錯目的，設定 ``PYTHONCOERCECLOCALE=warn`` 會使 Python 在區域設定強制轉"
"換啟動時，或者在 Python runtime 初始化時某個\\ *原本會*\\ 觸發強制轉換的區域"
"設定仍處於使用中時，在 ``stderr`` 上發出警告訊息。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1234
msgid ""
"Also note that even when locale coercion is disabled, or when it fails to "
"find a suitable target locale, :envvar:`PYTHONUTF8` will still activate by "
"default in legacy ASCII-based locales. Both features must be disabled in "
"order to force the interpreter to use ``ASCII`` instead of ``UTF-8`` for "
"system interfaces."
msgstr ""
"另請注意，即使區域設定強制轉換被停用，或者它找不到合適的目標區域設"
"定，:envvar:`PYTHONUTF8` 在舊有的、基於 ASCII 的區域設定中仍會預設啟用。必須"
"同時停用這兩個功能，才能強制直譯器在系統介面中使用 ``ASCII`` 而非 ``UTF-8``。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1242
msgid "See :pep:`538` for more details."
msgstr "更多細節請見 :pep:`538`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1248
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set to a non-empty string, "
"enable :ref:`Python Development Mode <devmode>`, introducing additional "
"runtime checks that are too expensive to be enabled by default. This is "
"equivalent to setting the :option:`-X` ``dev`` option."
msgstr ""
"如果此環境變數設為非空字串，則啟用 :ref:`Python 開發模式 <devmode>`，引入一些"
"因成本過高而無法預設啟用的額外 runtime 檢查。這等同於設定 :option:`-X` "
"``dev`` 選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1257
msgid "If set to ``1``, enable the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>`."
msgstr "如果設為 ``1``，則啟用 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1259
msgid "If set to ``0``, disable the :ref:`Python UTF-8 Mode <utf8-mode>`."
msgstr "如果設為 ``0``，則停用 :ref:`Python UTF-8 模式 <utf8-mode>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1261
msgid ""
"Setting any other non-empty string causes an error during interpreter "
"initialisation."
msgstr "設定其他任何非空字串都會在直譯器初始化期間造成錯誤。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1268
msgid ""
"If this environment variable is set to a non-empty string, issue "
"a :class:`EncodingWarning` when the locale-specific default encoding is used."
msgstr ""
"如果此環境變數設為非空字串，則會在使用區域設定特定的預設編碼時發"
"出 :class:`EncodingWarning`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1271
msgid "See :ref:`io-encoding-warning` for details."
msgstr "細節請見\\ :ref:`io-encoding-warning`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1277
msgid ""
"If this variable is set, it disables the inclusion of the tables mapping "
"extra location information (end line, start column offset and end column "
"offset) to every instruction in code objects. This is useful when smaller "
"code objects and pyc files are desired as well as suppressing the extra "
"visual location indicators when the interpreter displays tracebacks."
msgstr ""
"如果設定了此變數，它會讓程式碼物件不包含將額外位置資訊（結束列、起始欄偏移量"
"和結束欄偏移量）對映到每個指令的表格。當你想要較小的程式碼物件和 pyc 檔案，以"
"及想在直譯器顯示 traceback 時隱藏額外的視覺化位置指示符號時，這會很有用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1287
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to a nonzero value, it enables support for the Linux "
"``perf`` profiler so Python calls can be detected by it."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為非零值，則會啟用對 Linux ``perf`` 分析器的支援，讓它能偵測到 "
"Python 呼叫。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1290 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1303
msgid "If set to ``0``, disable Linux ``perf`` profiler support."
msgstr "如果設為 ``0``，則停用 Linux ``perf`` 分析器支援。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1292
msgid ""
"See also the :option:`-X perf <-X>` command-line option "
"and :ref:`perf_profiling`."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X perf <-X>` 命令列選項和 :ref:`perf_profiling`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1299
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to a nonzero value, it enables support for the Linux "
"``perf`` profiler so Python calls can be detected by it using DWARF "
"information."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為非零值，則會啟用對 Linux ``perf`` 分析器的支援，讓它能透過 "
"DWARF 資訊偵測到 Python 呼叫。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1305
msgid ""
"See also the :option:`-X perf_jit <-X>` command-line option "
"and :ref:`perf_profiling`."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱 :option:`-X perf_jit <-X>` 命令列選項和 :ref:`perf_profiling`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1312
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to a non-empty string, it disables the remote "
"debugging feature described in :pep:`768`. This includes both the "
"functionality to schedule code for execution in another process and the "
"functionality to receive code for execution in the current process."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為非空字串，則會停用 :pep:`768` 中所述的遠端除錯功能。這包括將程"
"式碼排程到另一個行程中執行的功能，以及在目前行程中接收程式碼以執行的功能。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1317
msgid "See also the :option:`-X disable-remote-debug` command-line option."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X disable-remote-debug` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1323
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to a positive integer, it overrides the return "
"values of :func:`os.cpu_count` and :func:`os.process_cpu_count`."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為正整數，則會覆寫 :func:`os.cpu_count` "
"和 :func:`os.process_cpu_count` 的回傳值。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1326
msgid "See also the :option:`-X cpu_count <-X>` command-line option."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X cpu_count <-X>` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1332
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to ``on`` or ``off``, it determines whether or not "
"frozen modules are ignored by the import machinery.  A value of ``on`` means "
"they get imported and ``off`` means they are ignored.  The default is ``on`` "
"for non-debug builds (the normal case) and ``off`` for debug builds. Note "
"that the :mod:`!importlib_bootstrap` and :mod:`!"
"importlib_bootstrap_external` frozen modules are always used, even if this "
"flag is set to ``off``."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為 ``on`` 或 ``off``，它會決定引入機制是否會忽略凍結模組。值為 "
"``on`` 表示會引入它們，``off`` 表示會忽略它們。非除錯建置（一般情況）的預設值"
"為 ``on``，除錯建置則為 ``off``。請注意，即使此旗標設為 ``off``，:mod:`!"
"importlib_bootstrap` 和 :mod:`!importlib_bootstrap_external` 凍結模組也一定會"
"被使用。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1340
msgid "See also the :option:`-X frozen_modules <-X>` command-line option."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X frozen_modules <-X>` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1346
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to ``1``, the interpreter will colorize various "
"kinds of output. Setting it to ``0`` deactivates this behavior. See "
"also :ref:`using-on-controlling-color`."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為 ``1``，直譯器會為各種輸出上色。將其設為 ``0`` 會停用此行為。另"
"請參閱\\ :ref:`using-on-controlling-color`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1354
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to any value, the interpreter will not attempt to "
"load the Python-based :term:`REPL` that requires :mod:`readline`, and will "
"instead use the traditional parser-based :term:`REPL`."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為任何值，直譯器將不會嘗試載入需要 :mod:`readline` 的、基於 "
"Python 的 :term:`REPL`，而是改用傳統的、基於剖析器的 :term:`REPL`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1362
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to any value, PyREPL will use :mod:`rlcompleter` to "
"implement tab completion, instead of the default one which uses colors."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為任何值，PyREPL 會使用 :mod:`rlcompleter` 來實作 Tab 鍵自動完"
"成，而非使用預設那個帶有顏色的自動完成。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1369
msgid ""
"This environment variable can be used to set the location of a "
"``.python_history`` file (by default, it is ``.python_history`` in the "
"user's home directory)."
msgstr ""
"此環境變數可用於設定 ``.python_history`` 檔案的位置（預設為使用者家目錄中的 "
"``.python_history``）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1377
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to ``1``, the global interpreter lock (GIL) will be "
"forced on. Setting it to ``0`` forces the GIL off (needs Python configured "
"with the :option:`--disable-gil` build option)."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為 ``1``，將會強制開啟全域直譯器鎖 (GIL)。將其設為 ``0`` 會強制關"
"閉 GIL（需要以 :option:`--disable-gil` 建置選項配置的 Python）。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1381
msgid ""
"See also the :option:`-X gil <-X>` command-line option, which takes "
"precedence over this variable, and :ref:`whatsnew313-free-threaded-cpython`."
msgstr ""
"另請參閱 :option:`-X gil <-X>` 命令列選項，其優先於此變數，以"
"及 :ref:`whatsnew313-free-threaded-cpython`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1388
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to ``1`` then :class:`~threading.Thread` will, by "
"default, use a copy of context of the caller of ``Thread.start()`` when "
"starting.  Otherwise, new threads will start with an empty context. If "
"unset, this variable defaults to ``1`` on free-threaded builds and to ``0`` "
"otherwise.  See also :option:`-X thread_inherit_context<-X>`."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為 ``1``，則 :class:`~threading.Thread` 在啟動時預設會使用 "
"``Thread.start()`` 呼叫者的情境副本。否則，新的執行緒會以空的情境啟動。如果未"
"設定，此變數在自由執行緒建置上預設為 ``1``，在其他建置上預設為 ``0``。另請參"
"閱 :option:`-X thread_inherit_context<-X>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1398
msgid ""
"If set to ``1`` then the :class:`warnings.catch_warnings` context manager "
"will use a :class:`~contextvars.ContextVar` to store warnings filter state.  "
"If unset, this variable defaults to ``1`` on free-threaded builds and to "
"``0`` otherwise.  See :option:`-X context_aware_warnings<-X>`."
msgstr ""
"如果設為 ``1``，則 :class:`warnings.catch_warnings` 情境管理器會使"
"用 :class:`~contextvars.ContextVar` 來儲存警告過濾器狀態。如果未設定，此變數"
"在自由執行緒建置上預設為 ``1``，在其他建置上預設為 ``0``。請參閱 :option:`-X "
"context_aware_warnings<-X>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1408
msgid ""
"If true (``1``) then :ref:`sys-path-init` is allowed to log warnings into "
"stderr. If false (``0``) suppress these warnings. Set to true by default. "
"See also :option:`-X pathconfig_warnings<-X>`."
msgstr ""
"若為真 (``1``)，則 :ref:`sys-path-init`\\ 過程中可以將警告記錄到 stderr。若為"
"假 (``0``)，則抑制這些警告。預設為真。另請參閱 :option:`-X "
"pathconfig_warnings<-X>`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1416
msgid ""
"On builds where experimental just-in-time compilation is available, this "
"variable can force the JIT to be disabled (``0``) or enabled (``1``) at "
"interpreter startup."
msgstr ""
"在提供實驗性即時編譯 (just-in-time compilation) 的建置上，此變數可以在直譯器"
"啟動時強制停用 (``0``) 或啟用 (``1``) JIT。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1424
msgid ""
"If set to ``1`` enables thread-local bytecode. If set to ``0`` thread-local "
"bytecode and the specializing interpreter are disabled.  Only applies to "
"builds configured with :option:`--disable-gil`."
msgstr ""
"如果設為 ``1``，則啟用執行緒區域位元組碼。如果設為 ``0``，則停用執行緒區域位"
"元組碼和特化直譯器。僅適用於以 :option:`--disable-gil` 配置的建置。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1428
msgid "See also the :option:`-X tlbc <-X>` command-line option."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X tlbc <-X>` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1434
msgid ""
"Controls lazy import behavior. Accepts two values: ``all`` makes all imports "
"lazy by default, and ``normal`` (the default) respects the ``lazy`` keyword "
"in source code."
msgstr ""
"控制惰性引入的行為。接受兩個值：``all`` 會讓所有引入預設都成為惰性引入，而 "
"``normal``\\ （預設值）則會遵循原始碼中的 ``lazy`` 關鍵字。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1438
msgid "See also the :option:`-X lazy_imports <-X>` command-line option."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X lazy_imports <-X>` 命令列選項。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1443
msgid "Debug-mode variables"
msgstr "除錯模式變數"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1447
msgid ""
"If set, Python will dump objects and reference counts still alive after "
"shutting down the interpreter."
msgstr "如果有設定，Python 會在直譯器關閉後傾印仍存活的物件和參照計數。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1450 ../../using/cmdline.rst:1458
msgid ""
"Needs Python configured with the :option:`--with-trace-refs` build option."
msgstr "需要以 :option:`--with-trace-refs` 建置選項配置的 Python。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1454
msgid ""
"If set, Python will dump objects and reference counts still alive after "
"shutting down the interpreter into a file under the path given as the value "
"to this environment variable."
msgstr ""
"如果有設定，Python 會在直譯器關閉後，將仍存活的物件和參照計數傾印到一個檔案"
"中，該檔案位於此環境變數的值所指定的路徑下。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1464
msgid ""
"If this variable is set to a module, that module will be imported early in "
"the interpreter lifecycle, before the :mod:`site` module is executed, and "
"before the :mod:`__main__` module is created. Therefore, the imported module "
"is not treated as :mod:`__main__`."
msgstr ""
"如果此變數設為一個模組，該模組會在直譯器生命週期的早期被引入，也就是"
"在 :mod:`site` 模組執行之前，以及 :mod:`__main__` 模組建立之前。因此，被引入"
"的模組不會被視為 :mod:`__main__`。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1469
msgid "This can be used to execute code early during Python initialization."
msgstr "這可用於在 Python 初始化的早期階段執行程式碼。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1471
msgid ""
"To import a submodule, use ``package.module`` as the value, like in an "
"import statement."
msgstr ""
"若要引入子模組，請使用 ``package.module`` 作為值，就像在 import 陳述式中一"
"樣。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1474
msgid ""
"See also the :option:`-X presite <-X>` command-line option, which takes "
"precedence over this variable."
msgstr "另請參閱 :option:`-X presite <-X>` 命令列選項，其優先於此變數。"

#: ../../using/cmdline.rst:1477
msgid "Needs Python configured with the :option:`--with-pydebug` build option."
msgstr "需要以 :option:`--with-pydebug` 建置選項配置的 Python。"
